                <pb facs="0132" n="28" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg28"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Mizner to Mr. Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-06-23"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 23, 1890</date>.
                        (Received June 24.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Mizner informs Mr. Blaine of the credited report in Guatemala of a successful
                    revolution in Salvador on the night of the 22d instant, during which the
                    President and others were assassinated.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
